820	# ----------------------------------------------------------------------------- review panel (-Panel)
821	#
822	# The roster is walked like the single-reviewer walk, without stopping at the first available
823	# entry (Select-PanelMembers). Each member then runs as a complete consultation of its own -
824	# a child run of this script (-PanelSpec), strictly one after another: own preflight, own
825	# task lock and recovery record, own parent thread (the newest of its lineage, or a new one;
