741	# Next consult number n and handoff number NN. No number that anything on disk
742	# already names may be handed out again:
743	#   n  > the ledger's entry count and every entry's n, every finding's
744	#        source.consult, every reviewer_checks[].consult, and the n of an
745	#        interrupted run's recovery record ($Leftover = .consult.pending.json);
