4291	#                                 with FileMode.OpenOrCreate and held open for the whole
4292	#                                 critical section; release = close the handle, never
4293	#                                 unlink (a contender that already opened the path must
4294	#                                 never end up locking a different file than the next
4295	#                                 one). The OS decides ownership: a holder that dies
4296	#                                 loses it with its handle. Share mode:
4297	#                                   * Windows: FileShare.Read - a refused contender can
4298	#                                     read the holder's record for its message, nobody
