4301	#                                     emulates with an advisory flock(LOCK_EX) (any other
4302	#                                     share mode maps to a shared lock that would not
4303	#                                     exclude).
4304	#                                 Cross-host exclusion (a task directory on a network
4305	#                                 share used from two machines) is out of scope. The
4306	#                                 content is informational only - { pid, start_time,
4307	#                                 host, task, started } of the current holder - written
4308	#                                 after the handle is held; overwriting it destroys
4309	#                                 nothing recoverable.
4310	#
