565	# review must not touch changed during the run, else the reason - the working tree (tracked
566	# or untracked files; the paths that changed), the collab directory (EVERY file under it,
567	# recursively: every task's stores and handoffs - outside the tree fingerprint; the run's own
568	# <task>/handoffs/NN-<prefix>-<slug>.* files and the .consult.* lock and recovery files
569	# excepted), the brief, an artifact. The check cannot tell who changed a file, so the text
570	# does not blame the reviewer (F09-3). Gitignored paths, submodules and files outside the
